00:47:59.460 --> 00:48:01.230
and I understand what they're doing,

00:48:01.230 --> 00:48:03.540
but I just don't think empirically

00:48:03.540 --> 00:48:05.800
that this is the path forward.

00:48:05.800 --> 00:48:08.400
And let's also keep in mind
that we have like a decade

00:48:08.400 --> 00:48:09.730
to clean up the electricity system

00:48:09.730 --> 00:48:12.660
or 15 years and changing the structure

00:48:12.660 --> 00:48:15.390
of these utilities will take a long time.

00:48:15.390 --> 00:48:19.670
And it's probably just not on the timeline

00:48:19.670 --> 00:48:22.720
that's possible when it comes
to cleaning up the system.

00:48:22.720 --> 00:48:26.430
So that is my view others
may have different views,

00:48:26.430 --> 00:48:27.870
but yeah I also write about that

00:48:27.870 --> 00:48:29.320
in the conclusion of my book.

