00:55:29.197 --> 00:55:31.160
but we only have a certain
amount that we can produce.

00:55:31.160 --> 00:55:33.690
This is by the way, from like landfills,

00:55:33.690 --> 00:55:36.610
CAFOs Concentrated
Animal Feeding Operations

00:55:36.610 --> 00:55:39.140
you know, factory farms, meat basically.

00:55:39.140 --> 00:55:41.300
We only have a certain
amount of that kind of gas,

00:55:41.300 --> 00:55:42.260
we should probably use it

00:55:42.260 --> 00:55:44.060
for the sectors that
are hard to decarbonize

00:55:44.060 --> 00:55:46.670
and where we're still gonna
