00:56:03.610 --> 00:56:05.200
I mean, it's really quite bad.

00:56:05.200 --> 00:56:07.610
The air pollution impacts
of gas in our homes.

00:56:07.610 --> 00:56:10.490
So we probably shouldn't be
using gas in our homes anyway.

00:56:10.490 --> 00:56:12.520
And if we have some renewable gas

00:56:12.520 --> 00:56:14.160
that's going to need to be used in sectors

00:56:14.160 --> 00:56:16.550
where we really can't
decarbonize other ways.

00:56:16.550 --> 00:56:19.670
So anyway, yeah, it's not a happy story.

00:56:19.670 --> 00:56:21.460
This is why we need transition funding.

00:56:21.460 --> 00:56:23.640
One of the things that the
